26:["$","p","The table below is a route comparison, not a list of universally open calls. Chevening’s 2027–2028 application round is closed on the official Pakistan page. Commonwealth publishes a 20 October 2026 closing date for its 2027–2028 master’s route, with a separate nominator process. Gates Cambridge has applicant- and course-dependent rounds; confirm the current official timeline.",{"children":"The table below is a route comparison, not a list of universally open calls. Chevening’s 2027–2028 application round is closed on the official Pakistan page. Commonwealth publishes a 20 October 2026 closing date for its 2027–2028 master’s route, with a separate nominator process. Gates Cambridge has applicant- and course-dependent rounds; confirm the current official timeline."}]
27:[["$","p",null,{"className":"table-scroll-hint","children":"On a small screen, scroll the table sideways to compare all columns."}],["$","div",null,{"className":"guide-table-wrap","role":"region","aria-label":"Different UK routes require different checks","tabIndex":0,"children":["$","table",null,{"className":"guide-table","children":[["$","caption",null,{"children":"Different UK routes require different checks"}],["$","thead",null,{"children":["$","tr",null,{"children":[[["$","th","Route",{"scope":"col","children":"Route"}],["$","th","Application question",{"scope":"col","children":"Application question"}],["$","th","Funding question",{"scope":"col","children":"Funding question"}]],"$undefined"]}]}],["$","tbody",null,{"children":[["$","tr","0",{"children":[[["$","th","0",{"scope":"row","children":"Chevening"}],["$","td","1",{"children":"Eligible taught course and separate scholarship process"}],["$","td","2",{"children":"Read the award conditions and remaining personal costs"}]],"$undefined"]}],["$","tr","1",{"children":[[["$","th","0",{"scope":"row","children":"Commonwealth"}],["$","td","1",{"children":"Eligible country, nominator and CSC application"}],["$","td","2",{"children":"Which benefits and applicant obligations apply?"}]],"$undefined"]}],["$","tr","2",{"children":[[["$","th","0",{"scope":"row","children":"Gates Cambridge"}],["$","td","1",{"children":"Graduate course, applicant round and funding deadline"}],["$","td","2",{"children":"Does the chosen programme meet award conditions?"}]],"$undefined"]}],["$","tr","3",{"children":[[["$","th","0",{"scope":"row","children":"University award"}],["$","td","1",{"children":"Admission-linked or separate funding form"}],["$","td","2",{"children":"Fee discount, stipend or complete package?"}]],"$undefined"]}]]}]]}]}],"$undefined"]
28:["$","section","4-Do not confuse a fee discount with an affordable offer",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-5","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Do not confuse a fee discount with an affordable offer"}],[["$","p","Ask for the total course fee and whether an award reduces all tuition, a capped amount or selected charges. Then add accommodation, food, transport, insurance or other required payments, travel and initial cash. A partial award can be useful while still leaving a large funding gap.",{"children":"Ask for the total course fee and whether an award reduces all tuition, a capped amount or selected charges. Then add accommodation, food, transport, insurance or other required payments, travel and initial cash. A partial award can be useful while still leaving a large funding gap."}],["$","p","For a fictional comparison, a course with a 12,000-unit fee and a 3,000-unit discount leaves 9,000 before living costs. Another course with a lower fee may be more affordable even if its advertised discount is smaller. These invented figures teach the comparison and are not UK price estimates.",{"children":"For a fictional comparison, a course with a 12,000-unit fee and a 3,000-unit discount leaves 9,000 before living costs. Another course with a lower fee may be more affordable even if its advertised discount is smaller. These invented figures teach the comparison and are not UK price estimates."}],["$","p","Record when each payment is due. An eventual stipend cannot pay a deposit that must be transferred before the award decision. Ask about refund conditions before accepting a financial commitment.",{"children":"Record when each payment is due. An eventual stipend cannot pay a deposit that must be transferred before the award decision. Ask about refund conditions before accepting a financial commitment."}]],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined"]}]
29:["$","section","5-Make a programme-specific application worksheet",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-6","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Make a programme-specific application worksheet"}],[["$","p","Create one row per course, even when several courses belong to the same university. Include the programme title, mode, intake, eligibility, language evidence, admission portal, funding application and deadlines. Save the official page used for every important condition.",{"children":"Create one row per course, even when several courses belong to the same university. Include the programme title, mode, intake, eligibility, language evidence, admission portal, funding application and deadlines. Save the official page used for every important condition."}],["$","p","Separate the tasks you control from the decisions you are waiting for. An application submitted is not an offer, and an offer is not a scholarship. Conditional admission may still require a qualification or language result before enrolment.",{"children":"Separate the tasks you control from the decisions you are waiting for. An application submitted is not an offer, and an offer is not a scholarship. Conditional admission may still require a qualification or language result before enrolment."}]],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined",["$","$L2b",null,{"id":"countries/united-kingdom:section-6","title":"Check your progress","items":["Course and award eligibility checked","University and scholarship deadlines kept separate","Reference method confirmed","Language conditions recorded","Uncovered costs and payment dates calculated"]}],"$undefined"]}]
2a:["$","section","6-Example: an applicant comparing two funding routes",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-7","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Example: an applicant comparing two funding routes"}],[["$","p","A fictional graduate has relevant work experience but needs substantial support for living costs. One option offers a tuition reduction attached to admission; another requires a separate leadership-focused scholarship application. The graduate first checks mandatory eligibility, then compares net cost and what must be submitted to each decision owner.",{"children":"A fictional graduate has relevant work experience but needs substantial support for living costs. One option offers a tuition reduction attached to admission; another requires a separate leadership-focused scholarship application. The graduate first checks mandatory eligibility, then compares net cost and what must be submitted to each decision owner."}],["$","p","If the larger award is already closed, the sensible next step is not to label it open because the course still accepts admission. The applicant can assess another viable route or prepare for a later officially announced cycle. Keep any expected future opening separate from a confirmed call.",{"children":"If the larger award is already closed, the sensible next step is not to label it open because the course still accepts admission. The applicant can assess another viable route or prepare for a later officially announced cycle. Keep any expected future opening separate from a confirmed call."}],["$","p","Use the dedicated scholarship guides for detailed conditions, and the writing guides to prepare evidence that belongs to your own experience.",{"children":"Use the dedicated scholarship guides for detailed conditions, and the writing guides to prepare evidence that belongs to your own experience."}]],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined",["$","nav",null,{"className":"answer-links","aria-label":"Next steps for Example: an applicant comparing two funding routes","children":[["$","$L4","/scholarships/chevening/",{"href":"/scholarships/chevening/","children":["Chevening guide",["$","$L5",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":"$12:props:children:1:props:iconNode","className":"lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"}]]}],["$","$L4","/scholarships/commonwealth/",{"href":"/scholarships/commonwealth/","children":["Commonwealth guide",["$","$L5",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":"$12:props:children:1:props:iconNode","className":"lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"}]]}],["$","$L4","/guides/scholarship-application/",{"href":"/guides/scholarship-application/","children":["Scholarship application plan",["$","$L5",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":"$12:props:children:1:props:iconNode","className":"lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"}]]}]]}]]}]
